Package: datascan
Title: Scan data for quick structural summaries and checks
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Emi", "Tanaka", , "dr.emi.tanaka@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-1455-259X"))
Description: Scans data for checking columns that are constant, bijective, missing or all unique. 
 Users can also try to identify the columns that uniquely indexes the observational unit and whether
 some columns are nested or crossed.
